cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TIME2WARC"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Flinkert"
    given-names: "Anouk"
    affiliation: "University of Bologna"
    affiliation: "KB National Library of the Netherlands"
orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-6190-8595"
abstract: >-
  TIME2WARC estimates the period in which retrospectively archived
  websites were made from their source code, using a fine-tuned
  RoBERTa model. The repository contains the code, the list of index
  fossils, the manual annotations and the results of the explainability
  analysis of the master's thesis "From Source Code to Metadata: Dating
  the XS4ALL Web Collection Through Computational Web Philology".
keywords:
  - web archiving
  - web philology
  - source code
  - dating
  - Transformer
  - XS4ALL
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/digitalctrlv/TIME2WARC"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-11"